{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<section class="story-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px">
      <p class="eyebrow dot" style="--acc:var(--white)">Our story</p>
      <h1 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,96px)">{{ s.heading }} <em>{{ s.heading_em }}</em></h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose"><p>{{ s.intro }}</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:30px">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="ph" style="border-radius:999px 999px 26px 26px / 420px 420px 26px 26px;aspect-ratio:4/5;padding:5px;background:var(--holo)">{% render 'pic', image: s.img1, asset: 'knightfall.jpg', alt: 'Knight Fall perfume oil in a forest' %}</div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow dot" style="--acc:var(--white)">It started in Morocco</p>
      <h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px);color:var(--fg)">Oils weren't a trend. <em>They were a lifestyle.</em></h2>
      {{ s.morocco }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">What we stand for</p><h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px)">Premium oils, <em>no fillers.</em></h2></div></div>
    <div class="values">
      <div class="value"><span class="n">0%</span><h3>Alcohol-free</h3><p>Oil-based roll-ons that sit close to the skin instead of drying it out.</p></div>
      <div class="value"><span class="n">100%</span><h3>Handmade</h3><p>Every bottle is blended by hand in small batches in Brisbane.</p></div>
      <div class="value"><span class="n">9ml</span><h3>Designed to last</h3><p>Because it's oil, a little goes a long way. One bottle can last for months.</p></div>
      <div class="value"><span class="n">$15–25</span><h3>Fair prices</h3><p>Premium-inspired scents without the designer price tag.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="prose" style="color:var(--pearl-ink)">
        <p class="eyebrow">Bigger than oils</p>
        <h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px)">Fresh, confident <em>and remembered.</em></h2>
        {{ s.bigger }}
        <p style="font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-size:28px">— Adam</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ph" style="background:#fff;padding:10px;border-radius:22px;transform:rotate(2deg);box-shadow:0 22px 44px rgba(50,30,90,.22)">{% render 'pic', image: s.img2, asset: 'collections.jpg', alt: 'The four perfume oil collections' %}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="visit">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="eyebrow dot" style="--acc:var(--tropic)">Visit us</p>
      <h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(34px,4.6vw,58px);color:var(--fg)">Queen St Mall. <em>Refills $15.</em></h2>
      {{ s.visit }}
    </div>
    <div class="ph">{% render 'pic', image: s.img3, asset: 'drive_moonlite.jpg', alt: 'Captain Moonlite in front of the Brisbane skyline' %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="versus sec" id="wholesale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="art">{% render 'pic', image: s.img4, asset: 'drive_aurabox.jpg', alt: 'Aura beard oil and its box' %}</div>
    <div class="vs-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow dot" style="--acc:var(--aura)">Wholesale &amp; bulk orders</p>
      <h2 class="display">Stock <em>Extract Lab.</em></h2>
      <p class="lead">{{ s.wholesale }}</p>
      {%- form 'contact', id: 'wholesale-form', class: 'form' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[Enquiry type]" value="Wholesale">
        {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
          <p class="form-msg full" role="status">Thanks, your enquiry is in. Adam will be in touch.</p>
        {%- elsif form.errors -%}
          <p class="form-msg full" role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <label class="sr" for="w-name">Name</label><input class="field" id="w-name" name="contact[name]" placeholder="Name" autocomplete="name" required>
        <label class="sr" for="w-biz">Business</label><input class="field" id="w-biz" name="contact[Business]" placeholder="Business name" autocomplete="organization">
        <label class="sr" for="w-email">Email</label><input class="field" id="w-email" name="contact[email]" type="email" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email" required>
        <label class="sr" for="w-phone">Phone</label><input class="field" id="w-phone" name="contact[phone]" type="tel" placeholder="Phone" autocomplete="tel">
        <label class="sr" for="w-msg">Message</label><textarea class="field" id="w-msg" name="contact[body]" placeholder="What would you like to stock?"></textarea>
        <div class="full"><button class="btn btn-holo" type="submit">Send enquiry <span class="arr">→</span></button></div>
      {%- endform -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="news" style="padding:0"><div class="box">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px"><p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p><h2 class="display" style="font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px)">Questions? <em>Ask Adam.</em></h2><p class="lead" style="font-size:16px">Scent advice, orders or custom blends. Email us, or message us on Instagram.</p></div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
        <div class="copyline"><code>{{ settings.contact_email }}</code><button class="small-btn" type="button" data-copy="{{ settings.contact_email }}">Copy</button></div>
        <div class="socials"><a href="{{ settings.social_instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a><a href="{{ settings.social_tiktok }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok</a></div>
      </div>
    </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Our story page",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "I'm Adam, founder of" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading_em", "label": "Heading (italic)", "default": "Extract Labs." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "intro", "label": "Intro", "default": "I'm 25 and based in Brisbane. Every product you see from Extract Labs is blended by hand from my home studio, from the fragrance oils to the beard oils, hair serums and skin oils." },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "morocco", "label": "Morocco story", "default": "<p>While I was there, I saw how deeply oils were part of everyday life. Argan oil especially was used for everything: hair care, skin care, grooming, fragrance and self-care rituals.</p><p>When I came back to Australia, I realised almost nobody here was approaching grooming and fragrance that way. Most products were alcohol-based, filled with unnecessary ingredients, or focused more on branding than quality.</p><p>So I started experimenting. I began blending oils by hand using argan and jojoba as the foundation, creating products that smelled elite and nourished the skin, beard and hair at the same time. What started as personal blends quickly turned into something bigger.</p>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "bigger", "label": "Bigger than oils", "default": "<p>Extract Labs is about self-care, confidence and products that feel personal. Whether you're walking into a barbershop, heading to work, going to the gym or getting ready for Friday prayers, I want you to feel fresh, confident and remembered.</p><p>This brand was built from curiosity, culture and experimentation, and every bottle still carries that same hands-on approach. Welcome to Extract Labs.</p>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "visit", "label": "Visit us", "default": "<p>Find us at Uptown, Level Q, Queen St Mall, Brisbane. Bring your empty bottle and get a refill for $15.</p><p>Not in Brisbane? We deliver Australia-wide. Orders are usually dispatched within 1–3 business days, and delivery is free over $99.</p>" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "wholesale", "label": "Wholesale text", "default": "We supply salons, barbershops, spas, concept stores and online retailers across Australia and overseas. Expect 40–50% retail margins, small-batch quality, fast dispatch and exclusive territory options on high-volume orders. Private label enquiries welcome." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img1", "label": "Photo: Morocco story" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img2", "label": "Photo: Bigger than oils" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img3", "label": "Photo: Visit us" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "img4", "label": "Photo: Wholesale" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
